# Third-party archives, reference interpreters, and bundled runners under vendor/
#
# All files in this directory carry their own licenses listed below and are
# excluded from the root MIT license (see ../LICENSE and ../README.md).
# Note: `dummy-wasi-runtime.c` (unused upstream leftover), proprietary
# `frink/frink.jar`, and custom subset stubs (`cjam.rb`, `glass.rb`, `fish.py`,
# `brain_flak.rb`, `run6502.py`, `runz80.py`) have been removed in favor of
# canonical upstream interpreters/emulators or standalone open-source languages.

