  * https://metacpan.org/pod/Acme::Chef (Steffen Mueller)
  * License: the same terms as Perl (Artistic License / GPL)

Grass: grass.rb
  * http://www.blue.sky.or.jp/grass/ (Ueno Katsuhiro)
  * License: BSD 2-Clause
  * slightly modified for Ruby 2+ (upstream mame/quine-relay)

GolfScript: golfscript.rb
  * http://www.golfscript.com/golfscript/ (Darren Smith)
  * License: MIT

LOLCODE: lci-0.10.5.zip
  * http://lolcode.org/ (Justin J. Meza)
  * License: GPLv3+

Piet: npiet-1.3e.tar.gz
  * http://www.bertnase.de/npiet/
  * License: GPLv2

Lazy K: lazyk.c
  * https://github.com/irori/lazyk (Copyright 2008 irori)
  * License: MIT (see lazyk.c header line 5)
  * Fork modification (line 19): RDSTACK_SIZE raised from 100,000 to 10,000,000
    for 256-step relay stack depth; Lazy K semantics are unchanged.

Shakespeare: spl-1.2.1.tar.gz
  * http://shakespearelang.sourceforge.net/
  * License: GPLv2

Velato: Velato_0_1.zip
  * http://velato.net/ (Copyright 2009 Daniel Temkin)
  * License: freeware non-commercial ("do with it what you want, just don't sell it")

## 3. Added in this fork — third-party upstream source & reference implementations

Malbolge Unshackled: Unshackled.c
  * Matthias Lutter (https://github.com/Lutter/malbolge-unshackled)
  * License: CC0 1.0 Public Domain
  * Untouched upstream reference interpreter executed by the relay Makefile.

Malbolge Unshackled (fixed 20-trit parity verifier): Unshackled-20.c
  * Matthias Lutter (https://github.com/Lutter/malbolge-unshackled)
  * License: CC0 1.0 Public Domain
  * Untouched upstream reference interpreter; compiled by vendor/Makefile for
    out-of-band rotwidth-independence parity verification ONLY (not invoked by
    the main relay Makefile).

K (ngn/k): ngnk-b9eeb91e.tar.gz
  * https://codeberg.org/ngn/k (pinned commit b9eeb91e0343ef6029f59d55dd98f82667b9bd59)
  * License: AGPLv3 (complete upstream source archive including LICENSE;
    vendored because upstream archived the repository)

